Subject: [PATCH] feat(telemetry): show FPGA/GPU/NPU metrics on CPU/RAM
 hardware dashboards

Fold a compact accelerator summary onto the environment tick so Processor
& Memory, Resource Monitor, Environment Intel, Mission Control, Operations,
Telemetry Wave, and the environment ticker render add-in cards next to
CPU and DRAM. Utilization stays null; hottestC is null without hwmon.
